 			<p>Beth spoke earnestly, and Meg promised she would go tomorrow.</p>
 			<p>“Ask Hannah for some nice little mess, and take it round, Beth; the air will do you good,” said Jo, adding apologetically, “I’d go, but I want to finish my writing.”</p>
 			<p>“My head aches and I’m tired, so I thought may be some of you would go,” said Beth.</p>
